{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"X\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S06→S08：两段都从回忆过去的亲近中获得短暂温暖，随后又想到未来遇事无人陪伴而陷入不安。S08基本重演了S06已经走过的“回忆取暖—想到孤单—心里悬起”，没有明显增加新的认识。\",\n    \"S04→S07：都在怀疑当初离开是不是错了、如果重新面对选择还会不会离开。S07虽然加入了孤单这一新代价，但仍然回到S04的选择后悔问题。\",\n    \"S07→S09→S10：反复围绕想不想回去、究竟舍不得什么、回去是否能恢复亲近打转。S09有所细化，S10也增加了对现实可能性的判断，但几段之间仍有较明显的原地犹疑。\",\n    \"S07→S08→S13：未来可能一直孤单、再也没有亲近的人这一担忧多次出现。S13虽然最终形成了独自生活也可以的态度，但此前的孤单焦虑已经反复回返。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S04→S07：两段都重新审视当初离开的决定，怀疑是否走对、是否后悔。S07加入了对孤单后果的认识，因此比单纯重复多了一层现实依据。\",\n    \"S06→S07→S09→S10→S13：对亲近关系的怀念和对未来孤单的恐惧持续出现。不过这些重复逐渐从想念旧生活，深入到害怕孤单而重新忍受委屈，再到认识到回去也未必找得回原来的关系，最后接受等待或独自生活。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X在S08尤其明显地回到了S06已经出现过的情绪状态，之后又多次重复回去与否、未来是否孤单的拉扯。Y虽然保留了相同主题，但通过S08明确区分怀念与回头，通过S09辨析想回去的深层动机，再通过S12形成不必在好与坏之间选边的认识，整体呈现出更清楚的逐层探索。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa7e2951-24e0-448e-ab86-5f1833f01832", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T093131073921Z", "elapsed_seconds": 40.766, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:32:11.851517+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "910874ed046714723efad7a5ed23a2e78763e56efeb65d9ded284c6d6d2f79fa", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T093131073921Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "20e83a441750c573b26858f8acaf1261843db16616d498eb499b3451f7e83784"}}}
